<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, background: '#FFFFFF', padding: '26px 64px 18px 64px', position: 'relative', fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei' }}>
    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 6, height: 104 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 36, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0F1E19', lineHeight: 1.3 }}>Permissioned RAG: Filter First, Then Retrieve</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#6B7A72', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>If the order is wrong, nothing built afterward helps</Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 44, height: 526 }}>
        <Box style={{ width: 620, flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center', gap: 14 }}>
            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 16, alignItems: 'center', padding: '14px 18px', background: 'rgba(22,119,98,0.07)', borderRadius: 8 }}>
                <Text style={{ width: 34, fontSize: 15, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#167762', fontFamily: 'Consolas' }}>01</Text>
                <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 2 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0F1E19' }}>Identify who this person is</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#44534C' }}>Identity comes from the corporate directory, not a self-built account</Text>
                </Box>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 16, alignItems: 'center', padding: '14px 18px', background: 'rgba(22,119,98,0.07)', borderRadius: 8 }}>
                <Text style={{ width: 34, fontSize: 15, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#167762', fontFamily: 'Consolas' }}>02</Text>
                <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 2 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0F1E19' }}>Narrow candidates to what they may see</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#44534C' }}>Filter by department / project / level; documents they cannot access never enter the computation</Text>
                </Box>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 16, alignItems: 'center', padding: '14px 18px', background: 'rgba(22,119,98,0.07)', borderRadius: 8 }}>
                <Text style={{ width: 34, fontSize: 15, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#167762', fontFamily: 'Consolas' }}>03</Text>
                <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 2 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0F1E19' }}>Run similarity search only within that scope</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#44534C' }}>Top-K is taken from the filtered set, not filtered after the fact</Text>
                </Box>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 16, alignItems: 'center', padding: '14px 18px', background: '#167762', borderRadius: 8 }}>
                <Text style={{ width: 34, fontSize: 15, fontWeight: 'bold', color: 'rgba(255,255,255,0.75)', fontFamily: 'Consolas' }}>04</Text>
                <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 2 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>Generate the answer; citations get the same filter</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: 'rgba(255,255,255,0.82)' }}>Sources in the answer can only be documents they are allowed to open</Text>
                </Box>
            </Box>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#6B7A72', lineHeight: 1.6, marginTop: 4 }}>Each step is a hard constraint, not a prompt that says "please do not leak."</Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center', gap: 20 }}>
            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 6 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#C2410C' }}>Why "removing results after retrieval" does not work</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#44534C', lineHeight: 1.65 }}>The model has already read that content, and the answer may already restate it. Deleting results only fools the eye; it does not undo text that has already been generated.</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ width: 100, height: 1, background: 'rgba(15,30,25,0.12)' }} />
            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 6 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0F1E19' }}>The citations are information too</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#44534C', lineHeight: 1.65 }}>File names, section names, and titles are often more sensitive than the body text. So the citation list must pass the same permission check.</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ width: 100, height: 1, background: 'rgba(15,30,25,0.12)' }} />
            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 6 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0F1E19' }}>Being able to say "not found" is what makes it usable</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#44534C', lineHeight: 1.65 }}>If the material does not contain the answer, say so; do not guess to fill the gap. In the demo, a question outside the knowledge base gets an explicit refusal.</Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 64, right: 64, bottom: 12, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#6B7A72' }}>SENTINEL · Secure Development Environment Plan</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#6B7A72', fontFamily: 'Consolas' }}>10 / 15</Text>
    </Box>
</Slide>
